# Proflet — Project Summary

## What is Proflet?
A property portfolio CRM SaaS app for UK landlords with 1-5 properties.
Helps them track rent, mortgages, expenses, maintenance, and profitability.
Replaces spreadsheets with a clean, simple web app.

## Business model
- £19/year (simple, impulse buy price point)
- No free trial — pay upfront, cancel anytime
- Target customer: solo UK landlords with 1-5 properties

## Brand
- Name: Proflet (profit + let)
- Colours: #173404 (dark forest), #3B6D11 (mid green), #639922 (bright green)
- Font: Georgia, serif
- Logo: rising bar chart mark + "prof" in mid green + "let" in bright green
- Tagline: "Stop managing your properties on spreadsheets"
- Domain: proflet.com (NOT .co.uk — important!)

